\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Then and now. Facet counts of the verified partition are listed in the certificate column. Every certificate in the last column was re-audited independently of the search code. $^{*}$A later run under a batched-retry configuration (\texttt  {results/s3\_20260920\_072055/seed17}, commit \texttt  {6857ce4} of the GPU repository, about $350$~minutes) produced an independently checked $13$-domain cover, $\mathrm  {SC}_{\mathrm  {strict}}(\partial \Delta ^4)\le 12$; listed for completeness, it does not improve the three-domain certificate. $^{\ddagger \ddagger }$A companion note \cite  {PM26} reports $\mathrm  {SC}_{\mathrm  {strict}}(K_M)=2$ (conditional on chains $\le 8$ links) via constraint programming (OR-Tools CP-SAT), exhibiting a subdivision gap of one unit: $\mathrm  {TC}(\|K_M\|)=\mathrm  {TC}(S^1)=1$ while $\mathrm  {SC}_{\mathrm  {strict}}(K_M)=2$ at level~$0$.}}{17}{table.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:records}{{5}{17}{Then and now. Facet counts of the verified partition are listed in the certificate column. Every certificate in the last column was re-audited independently of the search code. $^{*}$A later run under a batched-retry configuration (\texttt {results/s3\_20260920\_072055/seed17}, commit \texttt {6857ce4} of the GPU repository, about $350$~minutes) produced an independently checked $13$-domain cover, $\SCst (\partial \Delta ^4)\le 12$; listed for completeness, it does not improve the three-domain certificate. $^{\ddagger \ddagger }$A companion note \cite {PM26} reports $\SCst (K_M)=2$ (conditional on chains $\le 8$ links) via constraint programming (OR-Tools CP-SAT), exhibiting a subdivision gap of one unit: $\TC (\|K_M\|)=\TC (S^1)=1$ while $\SCst (K_M)=2$ at level~$0$}{table.caption.5}{}}
